- Top 3-4 rows: rippled surface undersides drifting right-to-left
- Sun disc around (7, 4) wobbling with caustic noise pattern
- Angled light shafts computed as `sin(x - y*slope + t)` added additively, fading only slightly with depth so they reach seafloor
- Hull: dark silhouette around y=1..6 (wider at top, tapers down), keel extends 3 more pixels; x drifts right-to-left over ~15s, tilts with sine
